  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Zambia Post buy-in for Land Facility</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Zambia Post buy-in for Land Facility project seeks to catalyse coordinated action on local land governance-related challenges through multistakeholder partnerships and to use the relationships, evidence and learning from these to nudge national level land governance reforms that enable sustained and scaled tenure security. Through partnerships and cross-cutting activities, the program will invest in approaches that resolve specific disputes/tensions related to land tenure insecurity and land use planning that can be found across Zambia, particularly those that have dimensions of gender and social inclusion.</narrative>
  </description>
